      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>asFile</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>asFile indicates that the provided binary input should be considered a single file within the build input. For example, specifying "webapp.war" would place the provided binary as <code>/webapp.war</code> for the builder. If left empty, the Docker and Source build strategies assume this file is a zip, tar, or tar.gz file and extract it as the source. The custom strategy receives this binary as standard input. This filename may not contain slashes or be '..' or '.'.</TableCell>
