      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>forcePull</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>boolean</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>forcePull describes if the builder should pull the images from registry prior to building.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>from</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/rest_api/objects/index#io-k8s-api-core-v1-ObjectReference"><code>ObjectReference</code></a></TableCell>
